  "details": "- https://hello.vrchat.com/vrchatplus\n\n- https://hello.vrchat.com/vrchat-plus-faq\n\nThe VRC+ benefits advert & FAQ pages at the above URLs do not list being able to change display names every 30 days - more often than 90 days for non-subscribers - as a VRC+ benefit. Please consider adding it.\n\nThis policy change (30 days) for VRC+ users was announced in [Developer Update - December 18 2025](https://ask.vrchat.com/t/developer-update-december-18-2025/47354) to be upcoming in January 2026 and according to a VRChat Wiki [diff 60721](https://wiki.vrchat.com/index.php?title=VRC%2B&diff=prev&oldid=60721) has been live for a few days (31 January 2026). It went live without patch notes.\n\nRelated: https://feedback.vrchat.com/website/p/update-vrc-feature-page",
